  "description": "Serve up mid-century nostalgia, vintage mascot charm, and bouncy retro sign-painted personality with RALLIES, a bold script font packed with OpenType features! Crafted with thick, fluid brush strokes, expressive loops, and a playful rhythm, RALLIES brings dynamic energy to every phrase. Rich in stylistic alternates and discretionary ligatures (including SS01, SS03, SS06, SS07, and DLIG), it lets you customize every swash and connection for an authentic hand-lettered look. A top-tier choice for bakery branding, diner signage, vintage packaging, mascot logotypes, retro merchandise, food truck graphics, and cheerful product packaging.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Serve up mid-century nostalgia, vintage mascot charm, and bouncy retro sign-painted personality with RALLIES, a bold script font packed with OpenType features! Crafted with thick, fluid brush strokes, expressive loops, and a playful rhythm, RALLIES brings dynamic energy to every phrase. Rich in stylistic alternates and discretionary ligatures (including SS01, SS03, SS06, SS07, and DLIG), it lets you customize every swash and connection for an authentic hand-lettered look. A top-tier choice for bakery branding, diner signage, vintage packaging, mascot logotypes, retro merchandise, food truck graphics, and cheerful product packaging.</p>",
